BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315550819@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260802T034530Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Sundays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n**PLEASE 
 NOTE** that we typically meet at 9AM unless one or more people comment wan
 ting to meet at 8AM. If you show up later and we have to rotate people in 
 then those who show up by 9 AM will have court priority. It all depends on
  how many people we have vs. court space on any given day. Keep monitoring
  the comments for any changes though keep in mind I typically don’t moni
 tor comments after 9 AM.\n\n**RULES:** By signing up you agree to follow t
 hese rules:\n\n1\\. No instruction or orders are allowed on any of our gro
 up courts\\. If two or more people are in agreement then they’re welcome
  to exchange instructions so long as they relinquish their court positions
  and don’t disrupt active players\\. If anyone is instructing or orderin
 g you and you’re not comfortable then please tell them or let me know\\.
  Everyone should feel free to play however they wish without being directe
 d without agreement\\\, most especially beginners\\.\n\n2\\. No formal loc
 ked\\-team matches are allowed on any of our group\\-reserved courts\\. If
  people are in agreement then they’re welcome to find another court not 
 in use by our group to play strict matches\\. If we need to rotate people 
 in and out due to lack of enough courts then we’ll use a structure I lea
 rned for balanced clinic matches\\. This typically includes quick matches 
 to 5 points after which everyone rotates clockwise one position\\. This ke
 eps those waiting rotated back in often and also discourages “dream\\-te
 am” scenarios trying to hold the court via wins\\.\n\n3\\. We are foremo
 st beginner\\-friendly and not aggressively competitive or an instruction\
 \-oriented group\\. A little light and friendly competition or giving a qu
 ick tip so long as you’re not holding up the court is OK but please pace
  yourself against the person you’re hitting to \\(e\\.g\\. hit softer to
  members that might not be as good or as aggressive as you\\)\\. Everyone 
 should be made to feel welcome and free regardless of skill level\\. Begin
 ners most especially should always feel comfortable here\\.\n\n4\\. Please
  make sure you’re signed up using a name that matches your Meetup name\\
 . New players should always check in with me so I can mark you down as hav
 ing checked in\\. Anyone showing up without a Meetup RSVP will be asked to
  do so before they can participate in the event\\. If you’re bringing on
 e guest that’s fine\\\, just make sure to mark them on your RSVP\\.\n\n5
 \\. If I feel you’re consistently not following the rules I have the rig
 ht to ask you to relinquish your position on the court\\. Please don’t s
 ign up and attend if you don’t agree to following any one rule here\\. W
 e are largely democratic but I reserve the right to make any final calls i
 f I deem it necessary for any reason\\\, such as breaking up and remixing 
 long\\-locked groups if we have more than one court\\.\n\n**EQUIPMENT:** P
 lease bring your own racquet and water\, as we don’t provide those. I al
 ways have some balls for at least one court\, but feel free to bring your 
 own in case we need to branch out over more than one court.\n\n**DISCLAIME
 R:** Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you make plans to 
 attend please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as needed. Furt
 hermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for your own heal
 th and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for rest and wat
 er at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315550819/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T234026Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T234026Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
