BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315837607@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260802T034530Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T210000
SUMMARY:Dave & Buster's (Wednesday)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI was thi
 nking those who want to socialize first should play pool for the first hou
 r or so since it's easier to converse this way. But pool is $6/hr cash onl
 y so you can't use your game card for this. Then after that we can hit the
  arcade games.\n\nWednesday is half price for all games except VR. Everyon
 e is responsible for all their own food/drinks games. If sharing games lik
 e pool then please split the cost evenly between each participant.\n\nI’
 m generally thinking: 1. grab a drink/food/chat 2. try to generally stick 
 together\, watch\, and rotate in for various games. I’m down for pool an
 d any 2 or more person arcade games like racing or shooters. But we'll try
  to default to the majority preference so please let us know what you thin
 k.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315837607/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260725T231156Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260725T231156Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
