SUMMARY:Asbury Park Beach Day - Bring Your Own Games\, Make New friends
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nLooking f
 or things to do in Asbury Park NJ this summer… we will park by the Water
 mark area but actually want to meet people — not just be around them? Th
 is is that event.\n\nThis is a women hosted event. We just enjoy the beach
  and we would love to make new friends... We’re bringing together fun pe
 ople from across New Jersey — including New Brunswick\, Edison\, Hoboken
 \, Jersey City\, Newark\, Princeton\, Morristown\, and surrounding areas 
 — for a fun\, social beach day. We’re bringing together multiple meetu
 p groups together...a high-energy beach day of games\, movement\, and a na
 tural way to connect without forcing anything. Please bring your own chang
 e of clothes\, towels\, beach pass\, games\, snacks and drinks to share. T
 o keep this group running\, kindly donate $5. 🔥 Why This One Stands Out
  Designed to meet other people in NJ (not apps) **Beach games = easy\, nat
 ural conversations *Come solo (most do) or bring friends* Flows from beach
  → bar → night out (if people want - bring bar appropriate clothes) 
 👉 This is how people actually meet in real life 📍 Event Details (Eas
 y to Find) Location: Asbury Park Beach by Watermark 2026 ⏰ Starts around
  1pm 🕒 Flow of the Day (You can come and go - just check the comments) 
 Meet at the entrance near Watermark. From the entrance\, we will setup at 
 the back of the beach... games + boardwalk...maybe until people want to st
 ay-> Beach bar social + boardwalk 👉 Come anytime. Stay as long as you w
 ant. 🏐 What We’ll Be Doing We’ll aim to set up volleyball + rotatin
 g group games or bring kites. If you want to bring any of the following ga
 mes: Volleyball Spikeball Frisbee / football Paddle ball Cornhole 👉 Mov
 ement makes it EASY to meet people 🎒 What to Bring Beach pass (required
  to pay for your own) • Your own drinks / food *Towel\, sunscreen\, anyt
 hing you need 👉 Keep it simple — come ready to enjoy the day 🚗 Par
 king Street + paid parking available nearby ⚠️ Important (Quick + Clea
 r) This is a community-driven meetup — not a hosted/structured event. 
 👉 You’re responsible for yourself + your belongings 👉 No transport
 ation coordination — please plan ahead 👉 Be safe\, respectful\, and a
 ware 👥 Who This Is For Singles looking for NJ social events or want to 
 just meet others • People tired of apps\, bars\, and low-energy meetups*
  Anyone who wants a fun\, social beach day 💥 Why You Should Come Becaus
 e most people say they want to meet new people… and never actually go. T
 his is one of those rare chances where it’s easy. 🎯 Simple Goal Meet 
 a few new people. Enjoy the beach. See where the night goes. ⚖️ Legal 
 + Policies By RSVPing\, you agree: *No liability for injury\, loss\, or da
 mages Photos/videos may be used for community promotion You may receive ev
 ent updates (unsubscribe anytime) Respect others + public space Attend at 
 your own discretion
