SUMMARY:Let’s Play Chess/Board Games!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n**For the
  chess players specifically:** I'm cross promoting this with another group
  event that's happening at the same time and place\, so feel free to jump 
 in with them. Here's a link to their event: Checkout this Meetup with Nort
 h NJ Tournament Chess Masters In Training: [https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbR
 S/](https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbRS/)\n\nWe will be meeting at Fort Nonsen
 se Brewery in Randolph\, NJ! This establishment sells an assortment of sma
 ll snack items and alcoholic beverages\, but personal food and drink can b
 e brought to the venue. If anyone joining this event would like to place a
 n order\, let us know\, we can pitch in.\n\n**For the more casual/social b
 oard gamers\,** or folks not into chess\, I'll have a healthy variety of o
 ther light to mid weight board games with me that support upwards of 8 to 
 10 players.\n\nSee you there!\n\nNOTE: If you are not attending the event\
 , please change your RSVP accordingly!
