SUMMARY:Ice Skating Hang Out - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nJoin us f
 or an hour or more of ice skating indoors at Montclair State Ice Arena\, 1
  Arena Dr.\, Little Falls Township.\n\n[Public skating](https://msu.finnly
 connect.com/schedule/260) is offered from 9 p.m. until 11 p.m. on Rocky Ri
 nk.\n\nNo experience is needed. Many figure out how to ice skate on the fi
 rst few tries\, especially if you've roller skated before! There are ice s
 upport structures and of course the wall that you can use to hold yourself
  up.\n\nThere's also an area immediately outside the rink to put your valu
 ables and chat when taking a break from the ice.\n\nIt's $20 for admission
  and $5 for skate rentals\, or what's $25 total. All you have to do is sho
 w up. We'll meet inside at one of the tables and will be skating at Rocky 
 Rink. Look for a growing group of people!\n\nJust another FYI. It gets som
 ewhat chilly while on the ice\, so if you get cold easily\, I'd recommend 
 bringing long pants and/or a coat.\n\nIf you don't have a car\, there are 
 some bus and train options to get you to Montclair State University throug
 hout the day. Definitely inquire if you're interested in learning more!\n\
 nQuestions? Thoughts? Ideas? You can message me on Meetup\, or call/text m
 e at 201-234-9609. Feel free to drop a comment below too.\n\nHope you'll c
 onsider attending our sixth ice skating event\, or joining us for a bowlin
 g\, volleyball\, tennis or other event -> www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowl
 ing-soccer-volleyball
